            <div xml:id="m-3024634e-d3d1-43ed-979d-698d8450f97e">
              <lg xml:id="m-f3244ee7-7bc8-4dad-83eb-742cf9522607">
                <l xml:id="m-6023428f-850f-4ecb-ac66-f0659cc4c6db" facs="#m-3ecd6502-2de1-4208-9701-f375b25d0fa9" label="ambiguous">--—</l><l xml:id="m-d222b47b-3bb0-4d33-955e-0127f4f57d79" facs="#m-8cf17a2d-de40-49c3-8ab9-62cc45df31c1" label="text-like">1194 Common of a Confessor not a Bishop. At Sext.</l><l xml:id="m-7bb69640-051a-4bfd-befe-79e6a8399490" facs="#m-52db70a1-0ffc-4e9e-86c9-ab121a54bb05" label="lyrics-like">aedi-fi-cá-vit dómum sú-am supra pétram. T. P. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9d500be-9bac-445c-acc0-70d28e720fbc" facs="#m-54669a3c-7c3c-4f5c-88c6-a656a5c68c07" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. Eu ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-29e5760b-6ad0-47c6-baee-6279f1c4ecfa" facs="#m-14b0fac0-6ca6-4d53-9d0b-a0fc630c2442" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. D. p. 207, or p. 213. — Prayer. p. 1199.</l><l xml:id="m-5c2ec396-76a4-4c22-890a-08eecea70df5" facs="#m-85cae1e5-d98d-45cf-b6ef-71a8e4bc3a7d" label="text-like">For Doctors, at rst and and Vespers, the Antiphon of the Magnificat. and</l><l xml:id="m-f8620bc7-aacf-4b4e-b3f4-ad3519920027" facs="#m-7e6ba375-263d-444d-b802-f6bfa5aac8fc" label="text-like">the Prayer are taken from the Common of Doctors, p. 1188.</l><l xml:id="m-55262317-cc0f-42ab-93ee-4ba82df8053a" facs="#m-59a2588a-4062-497e-a264-039cc2d056fb" label="text-like">Compline of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-7defe9c7-1ce8-4916-bd52-2274b5d56af0" facs="#m-9a594807-aa98-4e83-ad66-bba06653b2f5" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Dómine. D. 1195. Psalms as on Feasts. Short</l><l xml:id="m-e58cf970-1c6c-4b13-b5e3-8dc21db76f87" facs="#m-831d6db6-bb56-4514-815c-73a36e735277" label="lyrics-like">Lesson. Justum dedúxit. p. 1195.</l><l xml:id="m-de4ca203-4cce-4d71-a201-54581c96b933" facs="#m-95120e59-511e-4c9f-bcd2-6305d2ae2877" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-7bc9451b-69ca-4279-8883-782bbbc13b7b" facs="#m-7cfca060-8989-4cf5-9d20-562a741ea4fb" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Euge sérve bóne. D. 1195. Psalms of Sunday. Chapter of</l><l xml:id="m-95522e6d-fd27-41ba-a44b-6ee553d9c34e" facs="#m-d723a968-b088-4d58-a401-f755a5c5a5da" label="lyrics-like">Vespers. Beâtus vir. D. 1196. Short Resp. Amávit éum. p. 1174.</l><l xml:id="m-a983d078-8007-49c4-ba2e-68b72a902708" facs="#m-4ee799b7-a104-4b03-8d3a-f4dd4274abf8" label="lyrics-like">v. Os jústi meditábitur sapiéntiam. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-dbf2b6bb-01b3-4d86-8f9f-19f4babf9c19" facs="#m-44c34148-5b13-400d-ba37-fed1a6882452" label="lyrics-like">R. Et lingua éjus loquétur judicium. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-0965dfb5-c406-45e6-9e48-e76c6dc240a8" facs="#m-23388cce-d240-4145-a670-7b8d60b8183e" label="text-like">The Masses are found after and Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-0f78e0d3-dc88-410c-b5cf-7483e67e8b78" facs="#m-81f001f2-ce27-4ccb-baba-4b8e8df03cf6" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-c1d6004a-7767-41e8-896a-350abde2c480" facs="#m-8dcb8da2-00e5-4cb9-bf4c-45ca8fb33a3e" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Fidélis sérvus et prúdens. p. 1196. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-3f471d1c-98e6-416c-a10e-bffc5de51f42" facs="#m-7f35bfa4-8643-4c2d-a52a-7f4db7d45d0f" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-ec356816-d4f6-4cf0-9ca6-6ceb98a439d1" facs="#m-304237ab-59e5-4a19-a0ea-6bab2a72eda3" label="ambiguous">Eccli. 39.</l><l xml:id="m-c16877b5-b1c1-4884-8995-0fce6a50bb99" facs="#m-9df3bd50-eff0-400b-8d76-34b3a12fe8ec" label="lyrics-like">IUstus cor suum trádidit ad vigi-] qui fecit illum, *et in conspéctu</l><l xml:id="m-e2ac2548-f40c-43b2-a862-890928176870" facs="#m-87abb761-68f9-47f1-98b8-6dd8bbf4e1f8" label="lyrics-like">Cllándum dilúculo ad Dóminum, !Altissimi deprecábitur.</l><l xml:id="m-ac0397b5-3c08-4833-81b1-a8121911f73a" facs="#m-a89a2a3b-9d58-49ed-b117-52edbec938b7" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-b4951550-2ffc-4559-8d6f-a66da3d0de2e" facs="#m-574feb99-5e2b-4ca3-8222-5f1d03bc63d4" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-cedc7d0b-8c96-463c-bebc-6aed2d604b0f" facs="#m-2fa56282-f6c9-4290-ad46-2518c8ceb839" label="ambiguous">O</l><l xml:id="m-99b5bf86-6902-446f-b376-34802c0a68fb" facs="#m-0d06e9a4-bef3-45fe-abf9-c773d3cfa0fd" label="lyrics-like">S jústi “Medi-tábi-tur sa¬ pi-énti-am. V. Et lín¬</l><l xml:id="m-790d61f5-633e-417b-ad64-6aee78b318d2" facs="#m-1cd7f559-1ba9-4da1-804b-7d019f6f2c68" label="lyrics-like">gua éjus loquétur judíci-um. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-c320b3c8-39cc-4a11-b8e5-de188f7552aa" facs="#m-4c90a415-d554-4dad-bccd-e292ba539551" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-25a4cacb-eee8-480c-84cb-7895258ff13c" facs="#m-c7ef6e73-1624-4157-a8cd-298da0f451cf" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-92bf7c32-5b11-4144-915d-cd48fdb7c2b6" facs="#m-dcbf5775-9d1b-4f6a-b6f1-4cc9ff776a86" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-cc939faa-5310-4ca9-8d56-9d68101e7c38" facs="#m-18a194b2-4d18-40cc-8db2-edaa0f343c9c" label="ambiguous">0</l><l xml:id="m-b3115ffd-f420-4bc1-80ad-8298ed8275ca" facs="#m-ebdbef33-454a-42d9-9070-c5c4fe8d8ee6" label="lyrics-like">Sjústi medi-tábi-tur sapi-énti-am: “Alle-lú-ia,</l><l xml:id="m-96c9ef18-7f59-460d-9eb3-6971c69eec98" facs="#m-318e66f7-6abb-4809-b735-2d9076a19053" label="lyrics-like">allelú-ia. V. Et lingua éjus loquétur judi-ci-um. Gló-ri-a.</l><l xml:id="m-31cb5241-53f9-43ba-bf37-f5eb36e5760a" facs="#m-3c2c9539-1967-44c9-8768-3b34b6536e80" label="lyrics-like">V. Lex Déi éjus in córde ipsius. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-1150edc8-cc14-45b7-b913-e2968524210e" facs="#m-52f6a474-40da-4b83-8802-228e653b76d9" label="lyrics-like">K. Et non supplantabúntur gréssus éjus. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
